Subject: [PATCH] feat(telemetry): emit correlated runtime trace boundaries

Persist the runtime producer changes in the shared queue implementation consumed by the modern CMake target. Keep the legacy queue layout for unextended callers while carrying correlation metadata through ProgramReturn and PreviewReturn, and record the actual raw, DirectShow, and RTMP boundaries.

